title: "SIREN AI Siren Index"
message: "If you use this index, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "SIREN contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/messagegabrielhere-lgtm/doomcon"
url: "https://siren.watch/"
abstract: >-
  A real-time index of AI activity tempo computed from public data by open
  code. Five pillars, one 0–100 score, one level from SIREN 5 (DORMANT) to
  SIREN 1 (UNPRECEDENTED). Every number is recomputable; receipts are
  hash-chained. Live at https://siren.watch/.
keywords:
